<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/92e218a87bfc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Fake advertisements using AI technology began surfacing on social media platforms last week, with the singer's likeness telling fans she was working with the famed cookware brand, Le Creuset, to give away Dutch ovens." ;
